    "guideStep1": "Step 1 · Open the admin panel",
    "@guideStep1": {
        "description": "Router guide step 1 header"
    },
    "guideStep1Body": "Tap OPEN below — it launches your default browser at the router's admin page. (Or copy the address and paste it manually if you prefer.) You must be on this Wi-Fi for the address to work; mobile data alone won't reach it.",
    "@guideStep1Body": {
