    "privacyIntro": "Torcav is built on the principle of \"Privacy by Default\". Almost every byte stays on your device — no accounts, no cloud sync, no analytics, no advertising. A handful of features connect to public technical endpoints (Cloudflare, Google's captive-portal probe, public DNS resolvers) — those see only your IP, never any Torcav-internal identifier. You can wipe every persisted record with one tap.",
    "@privacyIntro": {
        "description": "Label for privacyIntro"
    },
