    "breachSafetyTitle": "Why it is safe to type your password",
    "breachSafety1": "The password itself never leaves your device — only a 5-character fingerprint prefix is sent over the internet.",
    "breachSafety2": "That 5-character prefix is shared by thousands of different passwords, so it reveals neither your identity nor your password (k-anonymity).",
    "breachSafety3": "The password is never saved or logged, and it is wiped from the screen the moment the check finishes.",
    "breachTransparencyLabel": "The only thing sent online",
